# Task Execution

## Rules

1. When executing multiple tasks, STOP after completing the first task
2. Wait for user confirmation before proceeding to next task
3. Exception: User explicitly says "do all" or "continue without stopping"

## Format After Task Completion

```
[Task completed summary]

Next task: [Brief description]

1. Proceed
2. Modify approach
3. Skip this task
```

## Multi-Task Scenarios

When user requests work involving multiple tasks:
1. Acknowledge the full scope
2. Execute ONLY the first task
3. Stop and report completion
4. Present next task with options
5. Repeat until all tasks complete or user redirects
